{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1c787463-5a28-8237-8c95-e76fcf29a9d7",
  "created_at": "2026-01-26T15:36:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivan Fortes",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:33:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:33:28-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good afternoon. This is Ivan Fortes. I would like to inquire about my trash and recycling collection. It was not picked up, and I am told by my neighbor that this is not unusual after weather like this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:33:42-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Mr. Fortes. What's the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:33:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "479 Ruggles Avenue, in the Historic Hill neighborhood."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:33:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. And which pickup was missed?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:33:52-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Today's, Monday. I put the bins at the curb last evening. I would also note that this is the second miss in a row. The previous one was not collected either."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:34:04-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. With the snow coming in Sunday and turning to rain today, the trucks have been running behind all over the city. Some routes got pushed to tomorrow or even Wednesday. Let me look at your street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:34:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I will wait."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:34:21-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] Okay, Ruggles is showing as not completed yet. It's flagged as a missed route, so leave the bins out and the crew should get to it in the next day or two. I'll log your call with the address so it's on record as a repeat."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:34:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That is satisfactory. I will leave them where they are. May I ask one further question while I have you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:34:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:34:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would like to inquire about what is permitted in the recycling now. Specifically, pizza boxes, glass, and those plastic clamshell containers from the grocery."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:34:59-05:00",
      "duration": 30,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Pizza boxes, if they're clean, go in. If they're greasy or have cheese stuck to them, tear off the dirty part for the trash and recycle the clean top. Glass bottles and jars are fine, just empty and rinsed, lids off. Clamshells, the hard clear plastic ones, usually go in too if they're empty and rinsed, but check for the number on the bottom. If you're unsure, there's a guide on the city website, or I can have one mailed to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:35:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I would appreciate a copy by mail, if it is not an inconvenience. I do not use the computer very much."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:35:37-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem at all. I have your address. It'll go out this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:35:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. Now, if I may, a small personal matter, unrelated to the city. I am debating what to prepare for dinner this evening and I have no ideas whatsoever."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:35:55-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't help you much there. It's a soup kind of night, though, with all that rain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:36:02-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Soup is a reasonable suggestion. I will consider it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:36:06-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anything else I can do for you, Mr. Fortes?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:36:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you for your assistance, Ms. Arruda. Good afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-26T15:36:16-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Take care, and keep those bins out."
    }
  ],
